eTechnical Skills:Advanced SQL for complex queries and data manipulationPython for data analysis and automation (pandas, numpy, scipy, etc.)Data Engineering Knowledge: Familiarity with ETL processes, data integration tools, and modern data platforms (e.g., Databricks)Data Visualization: Proven ability to transform complex data into clear, compelling visual narrativesCommunication: Excellent stakeholder management and presentation skills; fluent English (written and verbal)Working Style: Demonstrated autonomy, initiative, and ability to work independently in client environments
