&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Consulting (anciennement Velvet Consulting) est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé dans la transformation de l’expérience client. Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leurs projets Data, Marketing &amp;amp; Technology pour leur permettre d’activer pleinement la valeur de leurs données.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au-delà de VML Consulting, VML Enterprise Solutions réunit les expertises technologiques et data de VML pour accompagner les plus grands défis business. Avec plus de 10 000 experts dans 40+ bureaux à travers le monde, nous combinons conseil, expérience client, commerce et transformation technologique. Les équipes de VML Entreprise Solutions interviennent en IA, ingénierie, data, automatisation et déploiement de plateformes, en partenariat avec les leaders du marché : Adobe, Salesforce, Google, Microsoft, Braze, pour ne citer qu’eux. VML est ainsi le 3ème intégrateur de Salesforce dans le monde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le pôle MarTech de la BU Technology &amp;amp; Digital de VML Consulting recrute pour accompagner de grands acteurs (retail, banque, assurance, luxe,..) dans l’implémentation et l’optimisation de leurs plateformes marketing et CRM. Nous recherchons un.e Consultant.e Développeur MarTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton rôle:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Consultant·e Développeur.se MarTech, tu seras au cœur des projets d’intégration et de migration de solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et maintenir les flux de données entre plateformes marketing (Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, CDP, en particulier Imagino, CRM, outils internes…) et systèmes tiers via APIs et connecteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à la mise en œuvre technique des plateformes MarTech (configuration, scripts, intégrations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser, modéliser et optimiser les pipelines de données pour garantir la fiabilité et la performance des solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer avec les équipes projet pour assurer la réussite des déploiements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monter progressivement en responsabilité vers un rôle de référent technique sur des projets MarTech complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé·e d’une école d’ingénieur ou équivalent bac+5 en Informatique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 à 5 ans d’expérience professionnelle, avec une première expérience significative en développement ou intégration de solutions data/CRM/MarTech. Une connaissance de l’univers du conseil est un vrai plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise d’une ou plusieurs compétences techniques :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Langages : HTML, SQL, JavaScript, Java, Python, ou équivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APIsation et Web Services (REST, SOAP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bases de données relationnelles et manipulation de flux de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développeur.se, tu as des bases significatives en gestion de projets et un bon background sur tout ce qui touche à la data (qualité, flux,…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es curieux·se des environnements CRM &amp;amp; Marketing Automation (Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, CDP, en particulier Imagino…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu aimes travailler en équipe et résoudre des problématiques techniques variées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es bon communicant, capable de parler aux métiers comme à l’IT, et de comprendre les enjeux business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu parles couramment anglais (clients internationaux, capacité à travailler au quotidien en anglais).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’opportunité de monter en expertise sur des technologies MarTech de référence (Adobe, Salesforce, Imagino et autres CDP leaders du marché).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement stimulant, au croisement de la tech, de la data et du marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un cabinet à taille humaine intégré dans un grand groupe (VML/ WPP), combinant agilité et perspectives internationales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement de carrière personnalisé : certifications, formations, coaching technique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture collaborative où chacun peut devenir force de proposition et évoluer rapidement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu te sens prêt.e à rejoindre l’aventure ? N’hésite pas, postule !&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Consulting (anciennement Velvet Consulting) est un cabinet-conseil spécialisé dans la transformation de l’expérience client, appartenant au groupe WPP, leader mondial de la communication. Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leurs projets Data, Marketing et Technologie pour leur permettre d’activer pleinement la valeur de leurs données.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au-delà de VML Consulting, VML Enterprise Solutions réunit les expertises technologiques et data de VML pour accompagner les plus grands défis business. Avec plus de 10 000 experts dans 40+ bureaux à travers le monde, nous combinons conseil, expérience client, commerce et transformation technologique. Les équipes de VML Entreprise Solutions interviennent en IA, ingénierie, data, automatisation et déploiement de plateformes, en partenariat avec les leaders du marché : Adobe, Salesforce, Google, Microsoft, Braze, pour ne citer qu’eux. VML est ainsi le 3 ème intégrateur de Salesforce dans le monde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous avons besoin de toi ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour intégrer notre équipe Data, composée d’une cinquantaine de consultant.e.s et renforcer notre pôle Data Customer Insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu contribueras à l’amélioration de la connaissance client et constitueras une aide à la décision des équipes marketing de nos clients. Tu seras, entre autres, chargé.e des missions suivantes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyses de comportements clients,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segmentations,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scoring (churn, appétence, cross-sell,…),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyses des performances de campagnes,…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu réaliseras des projets de bout en bout, et seras amené.e à intervenir sur les phases de la prise de brief jusqu’à la restitution des résultats et des recommandations marketing auprès des clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es diplômé.e d’un Master d’orientation statistique, scientifique ou économétrie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu justifies d’une première expérience significative dans le domaine du marketing, idéalement dans un environnement Conseil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu t’intéresses tout particulièrement à l’application stratégique et opérationnelle des données sur la connaissance client et les actions marketing / ventes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu possèdes des compétences marketing&amp;nbsp;: capacité à effectuer des recommandations marketing, calcul d’un ROI, acquisition, fidélisation et rétention clients, identification de potentiel, de valeur et de durée de vie client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu possèdes les compétences techniques &amp;amp; statistiques suivantes&amp;nbsp;:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyses descriptives simples et avancées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyses prédictives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construction de scores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mise en place de segmentations opérationnelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Séries temporelles,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Méthodes de redressement de populations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equations structurelles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise dans les langages de programmation statistiques et technos suivantes&amp;nbsp;: Python et/ ou R, SAS, SQL Dataiku, Tableau/Power B&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu t’intéresses également aux méthodologies avancées type Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Intelligence Artificielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu t’intéresses également aux méthodologies avancées type Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Intelligence Artificielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu fais preuve d’esprit d’analyse et d’esprit critique, tu es team-player, tu aimes apporter ta pierre à l’édifice et faire partie d’une équipe, tu sais t’adapter, vulgariser pour faire le pont entre les équipes techniques et opérationnelles, tu es curieux et à l’écoute, tu exprimes une forte expertise dans ton domaine et adoptes une réelle posture conseil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu parles anglais couramment (nombreux clients internationaux).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu te reconnais dans ce profil, postule&amp;nbsp;! Viens rejoindre une équipe de passionnés, dont la data est le dada, dans un groupe qui allie créativité et technologie&amp;nbsp;!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Account Director to join our EMEA team and lead integrated marketing campaigns for one of the world&#39;s largest FMCG brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fast-paced regional role working across multiple markets (from the UK to South Africa and from Norway to the UAE), bringing together Strategy, Creative, Media, Social, Production and local agency teams to deliver outstanding work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role involves managing multiple complex projects simultaneously, partnering closely with clients and internal specialists across the EMEA region, and ensuring campaigns are delivered seamlessly across multiple markets and channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace new ways of working and actively use AI to improve efficiency, simplify processes and deliver smarter solutions for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a highly collaborative and supportive team where people trust one another, share ideas openly and work together to solve challenges. We&#39;re looking for someone who enjoys that kind of environment and naturally brings people together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple integrated campaigns across EMEA from briefing through to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted day-to-day relationships with clients across different business units, functions and categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Strategy and Media teams to develop integrated communications strategies and campaign toolkits that work across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with Creative, Social, Production and local market teams to ensure excellent execution across every touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex TV, digital and social production projects, ensuring high-quality execution and efficient delivery across multiple markets, channels and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign timelines, priorities and dependencies across several projects running simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks early, anticipate client needs and proactively solve problems before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve ways of working, making collaboration smoother, smarter and more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and lead a team of account managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualities for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrives in complexity: y&lt;/strong&gt;ou&#39;re comfortable juggling five or six projects simultaneously while remaining calm, organised and focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly organised:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you naturally create clarity, structure and momentum, even when working across multiple teams, markets and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brings people together: &lt;/strong&gt;you enjoy working with people from different cultures, disciplines, levels and backgrounds. Whether it&#39;s creatives, strategists, producers, media specialists or clients, you&#39;re able to build trust, align different perspectives and keep everyone moving towards the same goal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions-oriented: &lt;/strong&gt;you don&#39;t spend time looking for who&#39;s responsible for a problem. You focus on finding solutions, bringing people together and keeping projects moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takes ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;you anticipate needs, identify potential issues early and proactively drive projects without needing close supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced in complex production: &lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;re comfortable leading large-scale TV, digital and social production projects, coordinating multiple stakeholders and balancing quality, timing and practical delivery considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative: &lt;/strong&gt;you enjoy working in an environment where success is shared, people help one another and great ideas can come from anywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery focused: &lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;re comfortable balancing creative ambition with practical delivery, making smart decisions around production, timelines and available resources while maintaining the highest quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7–10+ years&#39; experience in account management within a creative or integrated agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering integrated campaigns for international or regional brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing large-scale TV, digital and social production projects across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple client stakeholders across different business functions and categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a multicultural, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English (C1 level or above).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with social-first content and integrated campaign production would be highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FMCG experience would be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the company that’s building the telemetry infrastructure for the AI era. At Cribl, we partner with IT and Security teams at many of the world’s biggest enterprises, including half of the Fortune 100, to bridge the gap between AI ambition and infrastructure reality. As the AI Platform for Telemetry, we give customers the choice, control, and flexibility to manage and analyze telemetry for both humans and agents, so they can build what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re one of the fastest‑growing private companies and a leading player in a massive, fast‑moving market. With a global workforce, we’re remote‑first and grounded in a simple idea: software is a people business. Cribl is the place where curious, collaborative people can do their best work, grow fast, and bring their full selves to the herd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Location: France&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Partner Solutions Engineer, Southern Europe, you’ll be the technical face of Cribl for our strategic partners across Southern Europe, enabling partner presales and consultants to run high-quality discoveries, PoVs, and deployments themselves. You will also have the opportunity to own and run pre-sales engagements within the commercial territory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll own partner-facing enablement programs and ongoing technical communities. You’ll collaborate closely with Cribl sales, partner managers, and distributors to build repeatable patterns that our partners can take to market at scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will help partners and customers understand the value of Cribl during the sales process, provide demonstrations and be the technical authority throughout the engagement to ensure the business benefits Cribl provides are understood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and coach Partners value pillars, use cases and business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architecture expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of Cribl University tracks, NFR environments and online resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive deal confidence, velocity, and account activities by aligning Cribl and partner sales activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase partner co-sell contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain partner status and contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a remote-first company and work happens across many time-zones - you may be required to occasionally perform duties outside your standard working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If You’ve Got It - We Want It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Channel Partners - experience of partner engagement, enablement and training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+yrs in Sales Engineering, Professional Services, or Consulting, working with cloud and SaaS based technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Logs, Metrics, IT Operations, and/or Security, ideally in observability, SIEM, or data platform contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing and delivering technical enablement (trainings, bootcamps, workshops, or office hours) for partner or customer technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling and presales skills—you can translate complex data architectures into simple, value-driven narratives and coach others to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run high-impact discovery with technical and business stakeholders to understand current tooling, data flows, constraints, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with proof-of-value or proof-of-concept projects, including defining success criteria, evaluation plans, and clear executive summaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Cribl in the partner community via events, webinars, and user groups as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with multiple operating systems (proficiency with Linux is desired).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of JavaScript and Regex, or similar scripting and data-manipulation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 40% to customers, partners, and event locations as needed. Some international travel is also required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of MEDDPICC, Command of the Message or any solution selling methodology, advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platform certifications advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and English is required, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-Italian, Spanish and Portuguese language proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-GV1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary for this role is dependent on country of employment and will be based on the individual candidate&#39;s job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to base salary, for sales and some sales-adjacent roles, employees are eligible to earn incentive compensation (commission). For all other roles, employees are eligible to participate in the Cribl Corporate Bonus Program.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Cribl offers a benefits package that may include retirement/pension support, paid holidays and paid time off, remote office setup support, equity, and other wellness and support programs. Benefits vary by country in accordance with local requirements and market practice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€97.400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€122.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Whole Self&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity drives innovation, enables better decisions to support our customers, and inspires change for the better. We’re building a culture where differences are valued and welcomed, and we work together to bring out the best in each other. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or any other applicable legally protected characteristics in the location in which the candidate is applying.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interested in joining the Cribl herd? Learn more about the smartest, funniest, most passionate goats you’ll ever meet at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cribl.io/about-us/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;cribl.io/about-us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Engineer I&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris (Hybrid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €54,000 - €70,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Client Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Software Engineering Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Paris and requires an existing right to work in France. At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Write clean, well-tested, and maintainable TypeScript to build and extend Kaluza’s platform for major clients including ENGIE, taking ownership of features from conception to deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-Native Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, deploy, and maintain highly scalable applications on AWS Serverless (e.g., Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB) and help design event-driven microservices with real-time data streaming via Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Integration: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and implement opportunities to embed AI into Kaluza’s platform and software development life-cycle - LLM-powered automation, intelligent decision support, and AI-assisted workflows. Act as an AI knowledge carrier, sharing learnings across teams and helping build a culture of AI-informed engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Quality &amp;amp; Mentorship: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion engineering best practices through thorough code reviews and upskilling junior engineers on TypeScript, serverless, and AI development patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate closely with your team, Product Managers, and Engineering Managers to refine features, estimate tasks, and deliver value predictably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TypeScript Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong professional experience building scalable, production-grade applications using TypeScript and Node.js, including on AWS Serverless architectures (Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB) and event-driven systems such as Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You think about AI as a practical engineering tool — curious about what’s possible, focused on what’s production-ready, and motivated to bring colleagues along with you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of creative problem-solving and delivering team-level technical expertise on complex application workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Practices: &lt;/strong&gt;A solid grasp of CI/CD pipelines, software development fundamentals, and Agile/Lean methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;Excellent communication skills and a genuine enjoyment of cross-functional teamwork, including explaining technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM Integration Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience integrating large language models into production applications, whether via APIs (e.g., OpenAI, Anthropic, AWS Bedrock) or open-source models, with a solid understanding of prompt engineering, context management, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tooling Advocacy: &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of introducing AI-assisted developer tooling and workflows (e.g., Copilot, Cursor, Claude or similar) into a team and upskilling colleagues, not just using it personally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy or Enterprise Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Background working with large enterprise applications, specifically involving billing, ledger tooling, payments integration, or energy grid/supply data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-Facing Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience working on consulting, software-as-a-service (SaaS) onboarding, or client-delivery technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in Kaluza on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Product Manager (Billing)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris — Hybrid (3 days in office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €57,600 - €72,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product Management - Billing &amp;amp; Payments&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: &lt;/strong&gt;Head of Product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in Paris, France and requires the successful candidate to be based in or willing to relocate to Paris. Fluent French and English (spoken and written) are essential for this position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please submit your profile in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the localisation efforts for our global energy billing platform, ensuring it meets the specific regulatory, market, and cultural requirements of France, from meter read to bill.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be in charge of the French localisation of the Billing Module—one of the core product domains at the heart of the Kaluza platform. The Billing module processes consumption, pricing, and account data to schedule, calculate, and generate accurate, timely, and compliant invoices throughout a customer’s lifecycle. The module automatically manages billing cycles, generates bills, handles corrections, and produces the data that feeds invoices, billing-related communications, payment schedules, and downstream financial reporting, while powering customer and agent UIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, full-stack product role — you&#39;ll work across the whole domain and alongside PMs from other domains and from the global billing teams to ensure the overall billing&amp;nbsp; journey from meter to bill meets the requirements of French clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate intensely with clients and in-country experts&lt;/strong&gt; to understand their unique needs and requirements, negotiate scope, and build a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep dive into French energy market regulations&lt;/strong&gt;, translating complex compliance needs into detailed product specifications for the billing system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and manage detailed product requirements &lt;/strong&gt;for features related to country-specific needs from getting a read to generating a bill (meter reading protocols, invoice formats, taxation rules, payment methods, and regulatory reporting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work closely with engineering, UX, and QA teams &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure the successful implementation and testing of localised billing functionalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as the go-to expert &lt;/strong&gt;for global teams on specific French market nuances related to energy billing and customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuously monitor changes in French energy legislation&lt;/strong&gt; and market practices, proactively adapting the product roadmap to maintain compliance and competitiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience as a Product Manager, or equivalent role in software companies&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong track record of successfully localising complex software products for international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid understanding of the end-to-end B2C billing lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt; including meter data, tariffs, invoicing, and debt management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record in regulated markets where billing complexity matters, &lt;/strong&gt;energy, telecoms, financial services, or similar. Familiarity with the French energy market (ENGIE, CRE, switching, tariff structures) is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional ability to translate abstract regulatory text or client requirements into clear, actionable, outcome-driven requirements for development teams.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; (engineering, design, legal, operations, client success) to deliver localised solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent stakeholder and client management skills&lt;/strong&gt;, able to lead conversations across requirements, scope, expectations, and roadmap alignment, and communicate technical &amp;amp; market complexity clearly to varied audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency in AI tools throughout all stages of the product lifecycle — from discovery and ideation to delivery and iteration.Fluent in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; — our platform and many of our teams operate in English, so you move easily between both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;re autonomous, learn fast, and aren&#39;t afraid to go deep. You&#39;re comfortable interrogating a codebase with AI tools, reading an API schema or data model, and writing a SQL query to get the answer you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and pace&lt;/strong&gt; — you can operate effectively when not everything is defined, know when to make a call, and aren&#39;t afraid to escalate or ask for help when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and very comfortable in English&lt;/strong&gt; — our platform and many of our teams operate in English, so you move easily between both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
