&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10-15 years’ experience in solution design, process optimisation, operations, technical consulting, or similar roles.&lt;/li&gt;
